@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@officer = PASTE_OFFICER_TOKEN_HERE

### Summary KPIs
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}

###

### Branch-wise
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/branch-wise
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}

###

### Company-wise
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/company-wise
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}

###

### Drive-wise
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/drive-wise
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}

###

### Monthly trend (12 months)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/monthly-trend
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}

###

### CGPA distribution
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/cgpa-distribution
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}

###

### Top performers by CTC
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/top-performers
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}

###

### Recent activity
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/recent-activity
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}